WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:05.250
New technologies have allowed us to really
rethink education as a journey

00:00:05.250 --> 00:00:07.090
rather than an event.

00:00:07.090 --> 00:00:10.802
And the new lead certificate is gonna
provide an opportunity for

00:00:10.802 --> 00:00:14.651
executives to engage in deep and
meaningful social interaction,

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:19.478
while at the same time consume education
at the pace that's appropriate for them.

00:00:19.478 --> 00:00:20.396
[MUSIC]

00:00:20.396 --> 00:00:23.727
The Stanford LEAD Certificate in corporate
innovation will provide you

00:00:23.727 --> 00:00:26.895
with the strategic business tools and
techniques to drive change and

00:00:26.895 --> 00:00:29.410
transformation within your organization.

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.521
We design this program for people who
wanna learn on the job,

00:00:32.521 --> 00:00:36.371
with the support of the Stanford faculty,
and a community of colleagues.

00:00:36.371 --> 00:00:38.480
[MUSIC]
The format is designed to be flexible.

00:00:38.480 --> 00:00:41.330
So that you could really, engage with the
concepts.

00:00:41.330 --> 00:00:43.110
Understand how they could be applied and

00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:46.839
allow you to start transforming your
organization, while you're in the program.

00:00:46.839 --> 00:00:48.632
[MUSIC]

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:52.252
You're gonna have the opportunity to
interact with Stanford faculty,

00:00:52.252 --> 00:00:56.410
Silicone Valley leaders, coaches, together
with your peers in the program.

00:00:56.410 --> 00:00:58.309
We have a rich set of elective courses.

00:00:58.309 --> 00:00:59.518
[MUSIC]

00:00:59.518 --> 00:01:04.310
All led by the best faculty from the
Stanford GSB and the university overall.

00:01:04.310 --> 00:01:08.100
They will have the opportunity to watch
self paced video lectures,

00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:11.430
exchange ideas and collaborate in team
based projects.

00:01:11.430 --> 00:01:15.660
Engage in class wide discussions, receive
ongoing peer and faculty feedback.

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:19.210
The participants will interact as team,

00:01:19.210 --> 00:01:22.860
sharing problems that have come from their
own business experiences.

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.960
Using that to help their colleagues in the
program,

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.890
through the challenges that they're facing
within their organizations.

00:01:28.890 --> 00:01:31.744
And each course in the program will have
multiple opportunities for

00:01:31.744 --> 00:01:33.304
live interaction with the faculty.

00:01:33.304 --> 00:01:35.679
[MUSIC]

00:01:35.679 --> 00:01:38.420
Stanford GSB is located in the heart of
Silicon Valley,

00:01:38.420 --> 00:01:42.140
one of the most dynamic and innovative
places in the entire world.

00:01:42.140 --> 00:01:45.980
And there's a unique mindset here the
faculty are highly engaged in

00:01:45.980 --> 00:01:49.630
thinking through how to translate their
material into this online environment and

00:01:49.630 --> 00:01:52.265
we're really going to be doing something
special in this program.

00:01:52.265 --> 00:01:56.100
We're really excited about the depth and
the rigor that we're gonna be able to

00:01:56.100 --> 00:02:01.270
put into this program, that's one of the
reasons why we've decided to give

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.445
participants the LEAD certificate at the
conclusion of this program.

00:02:04.445 --> 00:02:07.263
Cuz they can use to document, their
experience, and

00:02:07.263 --> 00:02:09.839
the expertise that they're going to take
away.

00:02:09.839 --> 00:02:13.175
[MUSIC]

00:02:13.175 --> 00:02:16.560
This is not a MOOC or a massive online
course.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:20.905
This is really a way of immersing yourself
in the Stanford community, and

00:02:20.905 --> 00:02:24.199
this is designed to be a highly selective
program open to

00:02:24.199 --> 00:02:27.022
high potential individuals around the
globe.

00:02:27.022 --> 00:02:28.475
Who are ready to engage and

00:02:28.475 --> 00:02:32.043
collaborate with a small community of
others live themselves,

00:02:32.043 --> 00:02:35.823
as well as the Stanford faculty in a
highly engaging online format.

00:02:35.823 --> 00:02:36.907
[MUSIC]

00:02:36.907 --> 00:02:40.562
It's flexible, collaborative, at your own
pace, on your own turf, and

00:02:40.562 --> 00:02:44.748
designed to meet the business challenges
that you're facing in your organization.

00:02:44.748 --> 00:02:48.809
[MUSIC]

